// A pass module that does not parse and that no program in this directory imports. It is the
// other half of `unparsable_pass.cml`'s case: a program's diagnostics report the
// modules the program is made of, so a pass library that fails on the command line appears only
// as the `InvalidPassParameter` of pass resolution, never as this file's bare `SyntaxDiag`.


